# --- dependencies & build output -----------------------------------------
node_modules/
dist/
.astro/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*

# --- environment & secrets -------------------------------------------------
# Never commit credentials. This project needs none today; if a form
# handler or analytics is added, its keys go here and into Sites → Secrets.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# --- mirrored third-party assets ------------------------------------------
# audit/ holds a local mirror of the restaurant's existing website (page HTML,
# CSS and logo files) captured during the Phase 1 audit. Those assets belong to
# Urban Tadka and are kept purely as internal evidence. They must not be
# redistributed, so they are deliberately not committed. Regenerate with the
# commands recorded in docs/01-website-audit.md if the evidence is needed.
audit/

# --- local tooling state ---------------------------------------------------
# Per-machine run instructions and platform preview state. Useful locally,
# but it records hostnames that differ per environment, so it is not committed.
.freebuff/

# --- alternate-host deploy workspace ---------------------------------------
# deploy/ holds a different host's worker, payload copies and rollback
# backups. Cloudflare Pages builds `dist/` from source itself, so none of
# this belongs in git.
deploy/

# --- editors & OS ----------------------------------------------------------
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
